=== FUNCTIONS / PUBLIC METHODS IN THE BOT (module -> function signatures and brief description) ===

Module: trade_manager.py
- class Trade:
    - __init__(self, symbol: str, side: str, entry_price: float, qty: float, meta: dict)
      - Simple trade container (open-time, closed flag, etc.)

- class TradeManager:
    - __init__(self)
      - Creates open_trades list.
    - can_open(self) -> bool
      - Returns True if open_trades < MAX_OPEN_TRADES.
    - open_trade(self, symbol: str, side: str, entry_price: float, qty: float, meta: dict = None) -> Optional[Trade]
      - Append a new Trade, log it; returns Trade or None when max reached.
    - close_trade(self, trade: Trade, price: float)
      - Mark trade closed, record close_price, remove from open_trades.
    - summary(self) -> List[Dict]
      - Return summary list of currently open trades.
    - compute_qty_from_balance(self, balance_usdt: Optional[float], price: float, symbol_info: Optional[Dict[str, Any]] = None) -> float
      - Position sizing: uses POSITION_SIZING_MODE ("fixed"/"auto") and contract_size if available.

Module: bybit_client.py
- class BybitClient:
    - __init__(self, rate_limiter: Optional[TokenBucket] = None)
      - Initializes REST/WS endpoints, sessions, rate limiter.
    - _session_obj(self) -> aiohttp.ClientSession (async)
      - Ensure and return a session.
    - close(self) -> None (async)
      - Stop WS and close sessions.
    - _get(self, path: str, params: Optional[Dict[str, Any]] = None, timeout: int = 12) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]] (async)
      - Generic GET with retries, wait/backoff, returns parsed JSON or None.
    - get_klines(self, symbol: str, interval: str, limit: int = 200) -> Optional[Any] (async)
      - V5 kline fetcher with verbose logging; returns list/dict per response formats.
    - get_latest_price(self, symbol: str) -> Optional[float] (async)
      - Return latest price via v5 tickers.
    - get_24h_ticker(self, symbol: str) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]] (async)
      - Return 24h volume/turnover/price change values (structured).
    - get_symbol_info(self, symbol: str) -> Dict[str, Any] (async)
      - Try to find symbol in get_symbols result and return parsed 'step'/'min_qty'.
    - get_symbols(self) -> List[Dict[str, Any]] (async)
      - Fetch all instruments via v5 instruments-info with pagination.
    - get_balance(self, coin: str = "USDT") -> Optional[float] (async)
      - Fetch wallet balance (available) for a coin.
    - create_order(self, symbol: str, side: str, qty: float, price: Optional[float] = None) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]] (async)
      - Place order (v5 order/create); returns result or None on failure.

    - Websocket helpers:
      - _candidate_topics(self, symbol: str, tf: str) -> List[str]
      - start_kline_ws(self) -> None (async)
      - stop_kline_ws(self) -> None (async)
      - subscribe_klines_for_symbols(self, symbols: List[str], tfs: List[str]) -> None (async)
      - subscribe_mtf_for_symbol(self, symbol: str, mtfs: List[str]) -> None (async)
      - sub_kline(self, symbol: str, tf: str) -> bool (async)
      - _handle_ws_message(self, msg: Dict[str, Any]) -> None (async)
      - _ensure_cache_slot(self, symbol: str, tf: str) -> None
      - _normalize_ws_kline_item(self, raw: Dict[str, Any], tf: str) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]]
      - _ws_loop(self) -> None (async)
      - get_ws_klines(self, symbol: str, tf: str) -> List[Dict[str, Any]] (async)
      - get_ws_latest_kline(self, symbol: str, tf: str) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]]
      - is_ws_connected(self) -> bool

Module: scanner.py (main, contains many helpers)
- class Scanner:
    - __init__(self)
      - Initialize client, trade_manager, token buckets, stores, caches.
    - register_callback(self, cb: Callable[[str, Any], Any])
      - Register event callbacks.
    - _emit_event(self, event: str, payload: Any) -> None (async)
      - Emit to callbacks.
    - _call_client_method(self, names: List[str], *args, **kwargs) -> Any (async)
      - Try multiple method names on client for compatibility.
    - _get_symbols(self) -> List[str] (async)
      - Normalize various client responses into a symbols list.
    - discover_symbols(self) -> List[str] (async)
      - Discover and optionally start WS subscriptions; seed klines and start rest poller.
    - _tf_to_seconds(self, tf: str) -> int
      - Convert TF string to seconds (numeric or 'D').
    - _call_get_klines(self, symbol: str, tf: str, limit: int) -> Any (async)
      - Wrapper for client get_klines.
    - _normalize_klines(self, raw_klines: Any, tf: str) -> List[Dict[str,Any]]
      - Normalize many possible API shapes into list of dict {start_at,open,high,low,close,volume}.
    - seed_klines_for_symbol(self, symbol: str) -> None (async)
      - Seed and store klines across TFs in kline_store.
    - seed_all(self) -> None (async)
      - Seed all symbols in batches.
    - _rest_poller(self) -> None (async)
      - Poller for REST updates when WS unavailable (updates short TFs).
    - _ensure_rest_poller(self) -> None (async)
      - Ensure rest poller running if needed.
    - compute_macd_for(self, symbol: str, tf: str, include_price: Optional[float] = None, use_ws_current: bool = False) -> (macd_line, signal_line, hist)
      - Compute MACD histogram list (uses macd_histogram module).
    - detect_flip_current_open(self, hist: List[float], hist_threshold: float = 0.0, symbol: str = "", tf: str = "") -> bool
      - Detect zero-cross flip prev<=0 and cur>0.
    - _quantize_qty(self, qty: float, step: Optional[float], min_qty: Optional[float]) -> float
      - Quantize qty according to market step and min_qty.
    - _update_24h_volume(self, symbol: str) -> Optional[float] (async)
      - Fetch 24h ticker and update internal 24h volume cache.
    - compute_24h_volume_change(self, symbol: str) -> Optional[float]
      - Compute % change between previous and current 24h volume (decimal).
    - compute_sr_levels(self, symbol: str, tf: str, lookback: Optional[int] = None) -> Dict
      - Simple S/R hybrid (swing highs/lows + pivot) and distance pct.
    - compute_ema(self, series: List[float], period: int) -> List[float]
      - EMA calculation (pure python).
    - compute_rsi(self, series: List[float], period: int) -> Optional[float]
      - RSI value (pure python approximation).
    - compute_technical_rating(self, symbol: str, tf: str, price: Optional[float], hist: List[float], vol_change: Optional[float]) -> Dict
      - Composite StrongBuy-like score built from MACD, RSI, EMA (short/long) and 24h volume change; returns {rating_score, rating_label, is_strongbuy, breakdown}.
    - send_signal_block(self, sig: Dict[str, Any], ev: Dict[str, Any]) -> None (async)
      - Send single Telegram message block for a signal (old screenshot-style format) including rating & 24h vol Δ and score.
    - _check_monitored_symbols(self) -> None (async)
      - Re-check symbols in monitoring list (Scenario B).
    - handle_root_signals(self, root_signals: List[Dict[str,Any]]) -> List[Dict[str,Any]] (async)
      - Main evaluation: compute MTF alignment, score, rating, decide accept/monitor, attempt opens (subject to STRONGBUY_REQUIRED_FOR_OPEN) — returns evaluated list.
    - send_summary(self, root_signals: List[Dict[str,Any]], evaluated: Optional[List[Dict[str,Any]]]=None) -> None (async)
      - Send: recommended opens block, root TF summary block (counts + listings for 1h,4h,1d), then per-signal blocks grouped by TF (60→240→D).
    - _compute_mtf_alignment(self, symbol: str, price: float) -> Dict
      - Returns MTF alignment verdict {'status': 'aligned'|'daily_rising'|'monitoring', 'tfs': {...}, ... }.
    - _build_mtf_state_str(self, tf_states: Dict[str,Any]) -> str
      - Compact emoji string for MTF states.
    - root_scan_loop(self) -> None (async)
      - Main loop: discover/seed symbols, poll symbols in batches, detect flips, dedupe signals, evaluate & send summaries/blocks, schedule sleeps aligned to ROOT_SCAN_INTERVAL or 5m boundaries.
    - run(self) -> None (async)
      - Start root_scan_loop in task and await it.
    - stop(self)
      - Stop scanner and cancel tasks.

