NOTES, WARNINGS and NEXT STEPS
- If you add new env variables to your deployment, ensure they are provided in Render (or other host) environment settings.
- STRONGBUY_REQUIRED_FOR_OPEN default is True in your current config; for a staging/paper test you may want to set it to False until you tune weights/thresholds.
- Debug envs (DEBUG_SURGICAL_LOGS, DEBUG_WS_LOG) are helpful when troubleshooting API shape issues — enable in staging only.
- The composite rating is a heuristic approximation of TradingView "Strong Buy" and must be backtested. Use TRADE_ENABLED=False and monitor Telegram to validate counts/labels before live trading.

